#: ../../source/development.rst:2
msgid "Development"
msgstr "开发"

#: ../../source/development.rst:4
msgid ""
"q2m3 uses a src-layout package, ``uv`` for dependency management, Ruff for linting, Black for "
"formatting, and pytest for tests."
msgstr "q2m3 使用 src 布局，以 ``uv`` 管理依赖、Ruff 检查代码、Black 格式化代码，并用 pytest 测试。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:8
msgid "Environment Setup"
msgstr "环境配置"

#: ../../source/development.rst:10
msgid ""
"Install the development tools and extras required by your task. See :doc:`getting-started` for "
"the workflow extras."
msgstr "安装任务所需的开发工具和 extras。工作流 extras 见 :doc:`getting-started`。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:18
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "测试"

#: ../../source/development.rst:20
msgid "Use the narrowest useful command first."
msgstr "先使用范围最小且能验证目标的命令。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:29
msgid ""
"Registered markers include ``slow``, ``solvation``, ``catalyst``, ``gpu``, ``rdm``, and ``sqd``. "
"The standard CI path skips slow and GPU tests."
msgstr "已注册的标记包括 ``slow``、``solvation``、``catalyst``、``gpu``、``rdm`` 和 ``sqd``。标准 CI 路径跳过慢速测试和 GPU 测试。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:32
msgid ""
"Tests marked ``external`` require a separate Psi4 environment from conda-forge. They skip when "
"``Q2M3_PSI4_PYTHON`` is unset. Set this variable to that environment's Python interpreter:"
msgstr ""
"标记为 ``external`` 的测试需要独立的 conda-forge Psi4 环境。未设置 ``Q2M3_PSI4_PYTHON`` 时，测试跳过。将该变量设为这个环境的 Python "
"解释器路径："

#: ../../source/development.rst:42
msgid "Installed profiles"
msgstr "安装配置"

#: ../../source/development.rst:44
msgid ""
"Run these commands from the checkout root. Use a separate environment for each profile. The "
"``core`` environment must contain neither SQD nor Catalyst extras. The ``sqd`` environment must "
"contain SQD dependencies and must not contain Catalyst. A full-extra environment cannot check "
"either isolation boundary."
msgstr ""
"从仓库根目录执行这些命令。每个配置使用独立环境。``core`` 环境不得包含 SQD 或 Catalyst extras。``sqd`` 环境必须包含 SQD 依赖，不得包含 "
"Catalyst。包含全部 extras 的环境无法检查这两个隔离边界。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:49
msgid "Set these variables before Python starts:"
msgstr "在 Python 启动前设置这些变量："

#: ../../source/development.rst:67
msgid ""
"Collection checks dependency isolation and test selection. It does not satisfy the execution "
"gate. Run each complete profile without a test-path restriction to check its required nodes and "
"coverage. A passing subset is insufficient. Profiles exclude slow and GPU tests by default. Non-"
"Catalyst profiles also exclude Catalyst and solvation tests."
msgstr ""
"测试收集检查依赖隔离与测试选择，不满足执行门槛。运行完整配置时不得限制测试路径，以检查必需节点和覆盖率。仅通过子集不足以满足要求。各配置默认排除 slow 和 GPU 测试。非 Catalyst"
" 配置还排除 Catalyst 与 solvation 测试。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:73
msgid ""
"For the optional serial slow run, use the provisioned ``sqd-catalyst`` environment and the "
"exported variables above:"
msgstr "可选的串行慢速测试使用已配置的 ``sqd-catalyst`` 环境，以及上文导出的变量："

#: ../../source/development.rst:80
msgid ""
"This command still excludes GPU tests. Larger tutorial campaigns belong in the manual slow-"
"science workflow. Shared CI does not promise to regenerate local calibration, historical G2B or "
"replay studies, or placeholder experiment reports."
msgstr "该命令仍排除 GPU 测试。较大的教程实验应放入手动 slow-science 工作流。共享 CI 不保证重新生成本地校准、历史 G2B 或回放研究，也不保证生成占位实验报告。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:84
msgid ""
"Shared artifact checks live in ``tests/examples/test_sqd_showcase.py``. They check saved fields, "
"signed errors, controls, failures, and output directories. "
"``test_real_h2_tutorial_matches_independent_casci`` checks the real H₂ tutorial. "
"``test_saved_showcase_directories`` additionally requires ``Q2M3_SHOWCASE_ROOT`` with the ``ci-"
"scan``, ``ci-embedding``, and ``ci-integrals`` directories. Without that input, the test skips. "
"Collection alone does not check those artifacts."
msgstr ""
"共享产物检查位于 "
"``tests/examples/test_sqd_showcase.py``。它们检查保存字段、有符号误差、对照、失败记录和输出目录。``test_real_h2_tutorial_matches_independent_casci``"
" 检查真实 H₂ 教程。``test_saved_showcase_directories`` 还要求设置 ``Q2M3_SHOWCASE_ROOT``，且目录含 ``ci-scan"
"``、``ci-embedding`` 和 ``ci-integrals``。缺少该输入时，测试跳过。仅收集测试无法检查这些产物。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:92
msgid "Linting And Formatting"
msgstr "代码检查与格式化"

#: ../../source/development.rst:100
msgid "For GitHub-facing changes, also run:"
msgstr "面向 GitHub 的改动还需运行："

#: ../../source/development.rst:107
msgid "Documentation Workflow"
msgstr "文档工作流"

#: ../../source/development.rst:109
msgid ""
"Write English pages as RST in ``doc/source/``. Chinese catalogs live in "
"``doc/locales/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES/``. They include API text from English docstrings. Keep source "
"docstrings in English."
msgstr ""
"在 ``doc/source/`` 中使用 RST 编写英文页面。中文目录位于 ``doc/locales/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES/``，包含英文 docstring 提取的 API"
" 文本。源码 docstring 保持英文。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:114
msgid "When you change documentation or an API docstring:"
msgstr "修改文档或 API 文档字符串时："

#: ../../source/development.rst:116
msgid "Edit and simplify the English source."
msgstr "编辑并简化英文源文。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:117
msgid "Extract messages and update the translation catalogs."
msgstr "提取消息并更新翻译目录。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:118
msgid ""
"Review the Chinese translations. Preserve conditions, units, formulas, reference targets, and "
"negative or inconclusive results."
msgstr "审校中文译文。保留条件、单位、公式、引用目标，以及负面或无定论的结果。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:120
msgid "Build and check both languages."
msgstr "构建并检查两种语言。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:131
msgid ""
"``make docs`` extracts messages, checks translations, and builds both languages with warnings "
"treated as errors. It also checks the generated site. English remains the default at ``/q2m3/``. "
"Chinese is at ``/q2m3/zh_CN/``. Use the sidebar language links to open the corresponding page in "
"either language. The switch does not preserve query parameters or section anchors."
msgstr ""
"``make docs`` 提取消息、检查译文，并以警告视为错误的方式构建两种语言；还会检查生成的站点。英文默认入口为 ``/q2m3/``，中文位于 "
"``/q2m3/zh_CN/``。使用侧栏语言链接打开另一种语言的对应页面。切换不保留查询参数或段落锚点。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:137
msgid ""
"The project UI message list is ``doc/ui-messages.json``. Update it when theme text changes. ``doc"
"/site-baseline.json`` records the starting commit and published page paths. Change its page list "
"only when you intend to add or remove published pages. Page moves also require catalog moves, "
"incoming link updates, and redirect checks. ``conf.py`` and ``_templates/redirect.html`` preserve"
" the former SQD and concepts URLs."
msgstr ""
"项目界面消息清单位于 ``doc/ui-messages.json``。主题文本改变时更新此文件。``doc/site-baseline.json`` "
"记录初始提交和发布页面路径。只有计划增删发布页面时才修改页面清单。移动页面还需移动翻译目录、更新传入链接和检查跳转。``conf.py`` 与 "
"``_templates/redirect.html`` 保留原 SQD 和核心概念网址。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:143
msgid "For an English-only preview, use:"
msgstr "仅预览英文时，使用："

#: ../../source/development.rst:149
msgid ""
"Commit PO catalogs. POT, MO, HTML, and doctree files are build artifacts. Sphinx writes English "
"HTML to ``doc/build/html/``. It writes Chinese HTML to the ``zh_CN/`` subdirectory. The builds "
"use separate doctrees."
msgstr ""
"提交 PO 目录。POT、MO、HTML 和 doctree 文件属于构建产物。Sphinx 将英文 HTML 写入 ``doc/build/html/``。中文 HTML 位于 "
"``zh_CN/`` 子目录。两种语言使用独立 doctree。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:153
msgid ""
"Keep default documentation examples small. Put H3O+, 8-bit QPE, dynamic Trotter scans, and memory"
" profiles in optional diagnostic sections. First-run tutorials should use the smaller examples."
msgstr "默认文档示例应保持小规模。将 H3O+、8 位 QPE、动态 Trotter 扫描和内存剖析放入可选诊断章节。入门教程应使用较小示例。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:158
msgid "Contribution Notes"
msgstr "贡献说明"

#: ../../source/development.rst:160
msgid ""
"Check public documentation against source code, tests, maintained examples, and the current "
"README. If these sources conflict with older planning notes, use current source code and tests."
msgstr "对照源码、测试、维护中的示例和当前 README 检查公开文档。如果这些来源与旧计划说明冲突，以当前源码和测试为准。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:164
msgid ""
"Scientific claims should name the active space, qubit count, QPE precision, Trotter settings, and"
" unit conversion assumptions when those values affect the interpretation."
msgstr "当科学结论的解释依赖相关取值时，应说明活性空间、量子比特数、QPE 精度、Trotter 设置和单位转换假设。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:168
msgid ""
"Contributors should not commit generated coverage reports, Sphinx build output, Catalyst IR cache"
" files, benchmark outputs, or temporary profiling artifacts."
msgstr "贡献者不应提交生成的覆盖率报告、Sphinx 构建输出、Catalyst IR 缓存文件、基准输出或临时剖析产物。"
